ATTACHMENTS — the reciprocal check: this app's own output, read by tools that
did not write it. Verifiers: libqpdf 12.3.2 (pikepdf 10.9.1), MuPDF 1.28.2 (PyMuPDF),
pypdf 6.14.2, poppler 26.10.0 `pdfdetach`. No `qpdf` or `mutool` binary on this box,
so this is four readers, not five.

